cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NeuroScan: Brain Tumour MRI Classification using Transfer Learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Krapah
    given-names: Elikem
    email: krapahbless@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/TheAce10/NeuroScan
abstract: >
  NeuroScan is a brain tumour MRI classification system using an ensemble of
  EfficientNetB3, VGG16, and DenseNet121 trained with focal loss. Achieves
  91.8% accuracy on the Brain Tumor MRI Dataset with a React/FastAPI web
  interface and Grad-CAM visualisation.
keywords:
  - brain tumour classification
  - medical imaging
  - transfer learning
  - deep learning
  - MRI
  - ensemble learning
license: MIT
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-06-12"
